    "name": "Answer Choice Warmup",
    "text": "1\nAnswer Choice Warmup\nInstructions\n\nOpen up a previously-seen LR or RC section*.\n\nTranslate the first four questions' answer choices in the style of a Written Answer Choice Translation Spreadsheet.\n\nRead only the answer choices for these four questions.\n\nDo not read the stimulus or the question stem.\n\nWrite down each individual answer choice.\n\nWrite down a Translation of each answer choice.\n\nThis means read A, write the literal text of A, and write the Translation of A. Then repeat the same process on B, C, D, and E.\n\nUse the same spreadsheet and same style as you used when you completed the Answer Choice Translation Primer.\n\nTranslate the next four questions' answer choices in the style of an Out Loud Answer Choice Translation Drill.\n\nRead only the answer choices in the section.\n\nDo not read the stimulus.\n\nDo not read the question stem.\n\nTranslate the answer choice out loud.\n\nQuip the answer choice out loud.\n\nThis means read A, translate A, and quip A. Then repeat the same process on B, C, D, and E.\nSEE FULL WORKOUT DETAILS",
