    "name": "E Blackout",
    "text": "3\nE Blackout\n1 SECTION\nInstructions\n\nComplete the section* according to your typical process, but make one small adjustment.\n\nChoose your answer without reading answer E.\n\nYou are allowed to choose E as a correct answer. You just can't read answer E before you choose it.\n\nYou may read answer E on the hyperskip pass.\n\nSEE FULL WORKOUT DETAILS",
